<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>

    <!--
        NOTE:
        This file previously defined two generic, non-inherited views on the
        core `mail.message` model (view_kavi_version_history_message_list and
        view_kavi_version_history_message_form), using field strings like
        "Changed On" / "Changed By" / "Change Summary".

        Because those records had no inherit_id and were never bound to any
        action or menu, Odoo registered them as fallback base views for
        mail.message. That caused them to be picked up by Odoo's standard
        debug "Messages" list/form (accessible via the bug icon on any
        record's chatter) everywhere in the database, replacing the real
        default columns (Date / Subject / Author / Related Document Model /
        Related Document ID) with the version-history-style labels.

        They have been removed to restore the standard mail.message list/
        form views. If a dedicated "Version History" message log is still
        needed, define it as its own ir.actions.act_window with an explicit
        view_id pointing at a properly scoped view, rather than as a bare
        (non-inherited) view on mail.message.
    -->

</odoo>
